{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "project-multilink-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.60: `project-multilink`, a PROJECT-domain run with TWO links on each on-network road type, computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE plus the run's PROJECT input database, which `inputs/washtenaw-project-multilink.esm` declares. It selects source types 21 and 32 (gasoline, which MOVES widens to four fuels each), road types 1, 4 and 5, and running and start exhaust (CO and Total Energy), brake wear and tire wear (PM10 and PM2.5), and THC permeation and fuel leaks.\n\nWHAT IT EXERCISES: MOVES iterates its execution locations over the Link table, so the four on-network links are four locations and every project generator runs once per link. The model's location relation is the run's three road types followed by the two links that share a road type with an earlier one (`lnk_locationOrdinal`, `n_projectExtraLinks` 2); ProjectTAG's SHO and SourceHours, LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator's brackets and tire wear's mode are per location, and MOVESOutput's link is the location's. Before the port the model refused it (`run_linkCountMismatches` 2: two links on each of road types 4 and 5) and summed their ids, speeds and volumes.\n\n`n_outputRate` IS 7654: the run's MOVESOutput rows. `run_domainUnported` is 0.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "project-domain"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-multilink/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
